# ContinuityOS — creative suite (official repos)
# ContinuityOS ships the ArtCraft suite (PhotoCraft/FilmCraft) as the *native*
# creative front end, but ArtCraft is early alpha / in development, so these
# mature, GPL tools ship alongside it for real work.
# See docs/COMPATIBILITY.md for the honest status of each.

# --- photo and raster ---------------------------------------------------------
gimp               # general raster editing
krita              # digital painting / illustration
darktable          # non-destructive RAW workflow
digikam            # photo library management

# --- vector -------------------------------------------------------------------
inkscape

# --- video --------------------------------------------------------------------
kdenlive           # non-linear editor
handbrake          # transcoding
ffmpeg             # the plumbing everything else uses
frei0r-plugins     # Kdenlive/OBS effect set

# --- 3D and motion ------------------------------------------------------------
blender

# --- audio --------------------------------------------------------------------
ardour             # DAW
audacity           # quick waveform editing

# --- capture and streaming ----------------------------------------------------
obs-studio
